<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Build battleship -->
  <GR_Mech_BB.label>建造战列舰</GR_Mech_BB.label>
  <!-- EN: Battleships carry unmatched firepower and have the largest hull size, but they are expensive and poorly maneuverable. -->
  <GR_Mech_BB.description>战列舰可搭载无可匹敌的火力，拥有最大的舰体规模，但成本高昂，机动性较差。</GR_Mech_BB.description>
  <!-- EN: Doing an unknown recipe. -->
  <GR_Mech_BB.jobString>正在执行未知配方。</GR_Mech_BB.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: Build frigate -->
  <GR_Mech_Corvette.label>建造护卫舰</GR_Mech_Corvette.label>
  <!-- EN: The frigate is one of the most basic warship types. It is armed and can engage enemies. -->
  <GR_Mech_Corvette.description>护卫舰是最基础的战舰类型之一，具有武装，可以与敌人交战。</GR_Mech_Corvette.description>
  <!-- EN: Doing an unknown recipe. -->
  <GR_Mech_Corvette.jobString>正在执行未知配方。</GR_Mech_Corvette.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: Build cruiser -->
  <GR_Mech_Cruiser.label>建造巡洋舰</GR_Mech_Cruiser.label>
  <!-- EN: Cruisers use a three-section design and can be freely refitted with additional modules if one is willing to pay. -->
  <GR_Mech_Cruiser.description>巡洋舰采用三段式设计，在愿意加钱的情况下可自由进行各种追加模组改装。</GR_Mech_Cruiser.description>
  <!-- EN: Doing an unknown recipe. -->
  <GR_Mech_Cruiser.jobString>正在执行未知配方。</GR_Mech_Cruiser.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: Build destroyer -->
  <GR_Mech_Destroyer.label>建造驱逐舰</GR_Mech_Destroyer.label>
  <!-- EN: Destroyers use a two-section design, allowing a wide variety of strategic armaments. -->
  <GR_Mech_Destroyer.description>采用双区段设计的驱逐舰可以提供多种多样的战略性武装。</GR_Mech_Destroyer.description>
  <!-- EN: Doing an unknown recipe. -->
  <GR_Mech_Destroyer.jobString>正在执行未知配方。</GR_Mech_Destroyer.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: Build torpedo boat -->
  <GR_Mech_Frigate.label>建造雷击舰</GR_Mech_Frigate.label>
  <!-- EN: The torpedo boat is an advanced derivative of the frigate, dedicated to launching torpedoes. They are slower and more fragile, but can deliver devastating strikes against large targets. -->
  <GR_Mech_Frigate.description>雷击舰是护卫舰的一种先进衍生型号，专职发射鱼雷。他们更慢更脆弱，但可以对大型目标造成毁灭性的打击。</GR_Mech_Frigate.description>
  <!-- EN: Doing an unknown recipe. -->
  <GR_Mech_Frigate.jobString>正在执行未知配方。</GR_Mech_Frigate.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: Build juggernaut -->
  <GR_Mech_Juggernaut.label>建造主宰</GR_Mech_Juggernaut.label>
  <!-- EN: These colossal constructs are both ships and space stations. The juggernaut is an enormous mobile station that can repair and build ships, serving as a forward base during offensive campaigns. -->
  <GR_Mech_Juggernaut.description>这些巨型构造物既是舰船也是空间站。主宰是一种庞大的可移动空间站，可以维修和建造舰船，也就是说，它可以作为进攻性战役中行动时的前进基地使用。</GR_Mech_Juggernaut.description>
  <!-- EN: Doing an unknown recipe. -->
  <GR_Mech_Juggernaut.jobString>正在执行未知配方。</GR_Mech_Juggernaut.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: Build titan -->
  <GR_Mech_Titan.label>建造泰坦</GR_Mech_Titan.label>
  <!-- EN: These giant warships are the pride of the fleet. Titans carry a variety of weapons and usually serve as flagships. -->
  <GR_Mech_Titan.description>这些巨型战舰是整个舰队的骄傲，泰坦上携带有多种武器，一般作为旗舰使用。</GR_Mech_Titan.description>
  <!-- EN: Doing an unknown recipe. -->
  <GR_Mech_Titan.jobString>正在执行未知配方。</GR_Mech_Titan.jobString>
  
</LanguageData>